Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.82,0:00:03.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.59,0:00:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我活在你脑袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.99,0:00:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道只有我感觉这就像个笼子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it me, or is this just like the cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.16,0:00:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 可怜的卡西迪奥都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Dean, what's poor, dead Castiel doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会出现在外面的那辆破车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that junker out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.23,0:00:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不知道他是小卡 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He doesn't know he's Cass. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这么办吧 我需要盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, here's the deal … I need friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们直接去找萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go straight to Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说没有别的法子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're saying there's nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.37,0:00:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让这个问题消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a problem I can make disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也许可以将它转移\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I may be able to shift it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不好吧 我们不能就这样丢下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I mean, we can't just leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.75,0:00:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能带着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we can't bring him with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.86,0:00:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界上的妖魔鬼怪都在找我们 这样安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything on the planet's out for us, okay? This is safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.29,0:00:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入我们 马斯特斯护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the team, Nurse Masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.17,0:00:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克在资助一个考古挖掘项目吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Dick's funding an archaeological dig?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.07,0:00:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一拿到箱子就会给我电话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will call as soon as the package is in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.14,0:00:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 但他很迫切想拿到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Whatever it is, he wants it bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.33,0:00:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就要拿到它 没得说\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means we got to grab it, end of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.49,0:00:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找这个已经找了很久很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking for this for a very, very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.97,0:00:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在怎么办 - 问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So now what? - That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.50,0:01:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先逃出几千里再想这个问题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we answer that a few thousand miles away from here, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.37,0:01:01.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.76,0:01:09.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（美国中等学校国家学生社团认证会员 凯文·谭）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.32,0:01:20.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（密歇根州 内博市）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.39,0:01:28.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伊利诺伊州 芝加哥南部）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.24,0:01:48.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（大提琴练习结束）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.16,0:02:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,普林斯顿大学刚把2013年录取率\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princeton just adjusted its acceptance rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.73,0:02:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 降至8.7% - 深呼吸 凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}- down to 8.7% for 2013. - Breathe, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.74,0:02:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在学习吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you studying?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.17,0:02:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正和你聊天呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.57,0:02:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十四分钟后开始学概率论和统计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll start on probability and statistics in 14 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我痛恨概率论\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate probability.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.08,0:02:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天是我拿到完美数学成绩的最后机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow's my last chance to get a perfect math score.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.08,0:02:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的SAT（相当于美国高考）很高啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your SATs are great!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.45,0:02:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱宁 所有人的SAT都很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Channing, everybody's SATs are great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.95,0:02:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得达到完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to do perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.66,0:02:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.41,0:02:26.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（入学申请文）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,申请文也很重要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The essays are at least as important.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.93,0:02:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在没什么可写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have absolutely nothing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.56,0:02:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂 我懂你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我读过一个被康奈尔录取的学生的文章\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read one by a kid who got into Cornell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.47,0:02:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都没有胳膊和腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't have any arms or legs or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.13,0:02:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,整篇文章都是用嘴打的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had to type the whole thing with his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.94,0:02:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,写得很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.92,0:02:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我们表现如何 有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, no matter what, one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,上大学什么的都是浮云了\N{\fnArial\fs30}college isn't going to matter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.25,0:02:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你胡说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.42,0:03:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为块破石头这么兴师动众的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a lot of fuss over a caveman lego.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.03,0:03:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.36,0:03:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克要的东西就封在这里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever Dick wants is bricked up inside that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.01,0:03:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这雷声像不像有人对你说「等等 住手」\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sound like somebody saying, "no, wait … stop" to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.94,0:03:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.21,0:03:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第7季第21集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.76,0:05:01.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（关键在解读）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.86,0:05:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想当人群转过这个角后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the line might panic when they turn this corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.37,0:05:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见刀朝他们飞来会慌乱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}see the blade assembly up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.29,0:05:15.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（迪克来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺奇怪的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange, isn't it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.78,0:05:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然有人起名叫迪克（混蛋）\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone would choose to be named Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.35,0:05:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.45,0:05:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是凯文·谭的语音信箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Kevin Tran's voicemail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 是妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, it's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你已经在学校了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're at school already,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.65,0:05:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上要考试\N{\fnArial\fs30}about to take the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你所有的辛苦努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know all your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.62,0:05:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都将铸就你的成功 - 22了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- will net the results we've discussed… - 22!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.16,0:05:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搞毛啊 - 但就像恩德博士说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?! - …but like Dr. Ender said,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.82,0:05:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过分执着于「完美」\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't obsess on the "perfect."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.59,0:05:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.06,0:05:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能成功 那就是锦上添花\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just a nice feather in our cap, if we get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 我们最后一节的研讨会马上结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Kevin, we're about to finish up our last seminar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.57,0:05:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的飞机是早上七点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My flight's confirmed for 7:00,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.77,0:05:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们明天早饭时见\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'll see you at breakfast tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.67,0:06:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.21,0:06:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场横贯大陆的暴风雨令人不解\N{\fnArial\fs30}…at a lost to explain the continent-wide storm system…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这暴风雨突如其来\N{\fnArial\fs30}that appeared seemingly out of nowhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.78,0:06:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,电闪雷鸣笼罩了国家大部分地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}blanketing a good part of the nation in freak lightning displays.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.19,0:06:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,马龙博士 美国气象学会的理事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here with Dr. Marlon, price of the US meteorological society servey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.49,0:06:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早些时候举行了一场新闻发布会\N{\fnArial\fs30}had a press conference earlier today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.85,0:06:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有觉得「不解」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Baffled"? No, I'm not baffled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.76,0:06:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我觉得生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankly, I'm offended.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种天气现象实在反常\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not the way weather behaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.65,0:06:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.18,0:06:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在罗曼那儿闹的那一出\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that whole adventure at Roman's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.69,0:06:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎让他耗尽了能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}seems to have drained his batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.63,0:06:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场到处在报道的风暴是我们整出来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We start the storm heard 'round the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.73,0:06:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们昨晚把这东西弄出来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we broke this thing open last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.63,0:07:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百英里半径内的每个产房都人满为患\N{\fnArial\fs30}every maternity ward within a hundred-mile radius got slammed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.24,0:07:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎所有在孕期最后一个月的孕妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like any woman in the last month of her pregnancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,都生产了\N{\fnArial\fs30}went into labor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.14,0:07:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西能影响女人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one goes out to all the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些重要的标示 预兆 查到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, heavyweight signs, omens … what do we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.25,0:07:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这是某种文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume it's writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.51,0:07:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过这样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen anything like it, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.75,0:07:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且在书上和网上也什么都没查到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it doesn't match anything in any book or online.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.69,0:07:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 超级大嘴怪降临人世\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so big daddy chomper lands here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.86,0:07:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他弄了个叫迪克的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He grabs himself some Dick…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他开始秘密认购大学的各个系\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then he starts secretly underwriting university departments,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,大量投资考古挖掘 都是为了找这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}pouring money into digs … all for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.34,0:07:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.51,0:07:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但可以肯定不把这个弄回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do know that he will be tearing new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.50,0:07:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会罢休\N{\fnArial\fs30}until he gets it back, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.81,0:07:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得稍微缓一缓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we got to take a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.27,0:07:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个安全的地方 查明这东西的来头\N{\fnArial\fs30}hole up somewhere safe, find out what we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.95,0:07:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,去鲁弗斯的小屋怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus' cabin, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.18,0:07:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我去采购\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time, I'm doing the shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.71,0:07:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅格打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.37,0:07:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 小帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What up, Bullwinkle?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.53,0:07:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话给你们汇报一声 你们的好小伙醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little FYI call. Your boy's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 小卡醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Cass is awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.67,0:08:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候 什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When? When?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.61,0:08:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚八点左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night about 8:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.91,0:08:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等到现在才告诉我们啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you waited till now to call us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.47,0:08:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忙着照顾小卡呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been busy with Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.68,0:08:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和他昏迷的时候不太一样 知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just a tad different than when he dozed off, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.75,0:08:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思 什么不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, different?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,大帅哥 你猜咋的 姐不是护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Seacrest, guess what … not a nurse,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在电视上扮过\N{\fnArial\fs30}just playing one on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.60,0:08:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要答案吗 开车过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want answers? Start driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.49,0:08:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,去印第安纳州吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Indiana?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.62,0:08:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚八点\N{\fnArial\fs30}8:00 last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.06,0:08:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我们把那东西取出来的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same time we opened up that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.80,0:08:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.01,0:08:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 你去哪儿了 考试都没参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin? Where were you today? You missed the test!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.31,0:08:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.54,0:08:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有学生会和四重奏也没来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And student council and quartet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.68,0:08:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去取我妈妈的车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to take my mom's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.01,0:08:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像发癫痫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I had a seizure or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.15,0:08:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是天选之子 天命如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been chosen. It's my birthright.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 凯文 你的压力太大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god, Kevin, all the pressure you've been under.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.70,0:09:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会也成了那种精神崩溃的神童吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't one of those overachiever-teen meltdowns, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.15,0:09:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.25,0:09:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not allowed to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.52,0:09:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "Not allowed"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.81,0:09:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你旁边有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is someone with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.10,0:09:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们逼你开走你妈妈的车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't make you take your mother's car, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.61,0:09:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一路紧赶慢赶 这会儿我却没底气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We raced all the way here. Now I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.35,0:09:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢面对残破不堪的他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't say I'm fired up to see what's left of the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他什么都不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he remembers at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.03,0:09:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 而且我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, and I'm guessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.66,0:09:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从你那儿拿走的地狱梦魇\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever kind of hell baggage he lifted off of your plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是不容乐观\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna be pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.97,0:09:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 两位 探访时间早过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Excuse me, gentlemen, but it's way past visiting hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 艾伯 我等着他们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Abel. I've been expecting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.97,0:09:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位帅哥好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.46,0:10:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.24,0:10:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你 能说能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you, walkin' and talkin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太棒了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's … that's great, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.12,0:10:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉我的手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull my finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.05,0:10:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.32,0:10:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}My finger …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.86,0:10:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉一拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.71,0:11:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hang on, Cass. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.31,0:11:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先搞清楚你的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us catch up to you for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.21,0:11:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是 你记得你是谁 你的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're saying you remember who you are, what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天在外面的花园里 我跟着一只蜜蜂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside today, in the garden, I followed a honeybee.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.53,0:11:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了采花的路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the route of flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个流程就摆在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right there, the whole plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要任何其他的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to add.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.87,0:11:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许需要点安定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to add a little thorazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.64,0:11:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.17,0:11:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他醒来之后就像个胡言乱语的裸奔男\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been like the naked guy at the rave ever since he woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.77,0:11:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,彻头彻尾的废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.14,0:11:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们瞧瞧她 我的看管人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you look at her? My caretaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种刺疼的感觉 多么美啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of that thorny pain. So beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.72,0:11:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈过的 我不喜欢吟诗作对\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been over this. I don't like poetry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put up or shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.85,0:11:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 你说你是昨晚醒来的对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Cass, you said you woke up last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.09,0:11:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.26,0:11:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了一个清脆的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard a ping that pierced me, and, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.60,0:11:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wouldn't have heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:12:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定听不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you were an angel at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.43,0:12:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我们打开了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's also when we opened this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样啊 我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Of course. Now I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.77,0:12:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你们啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.11,0:12:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.55,0:12:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也说得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I guess that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.71,0:12:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么说得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.55,0:12:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果说有谁能从地宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}If someone was going to free the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.52,0:12:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,掘出神之语 那肯定就是你们两位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the vault of the earth, it would end up being you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.92,0:12:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 差不多行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.20,0:12:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先前说什么神之语\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said something about "The word."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是指写在上面的字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what's written on there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.37,0:12:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道猫的阴茎上有锋利的倒刺吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know that a cat's penis is sharply barbed along its shaft?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.47,0:12:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这种事不能跟女人讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know for a fact the females were not consulted about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.07,0:12:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 我们形势很不利 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, please, we're losing ground out there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.41,0:12:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you not see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是梅塔特隆的笔迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the handwriting of Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.32,0:12:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.82,0:12:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说那玩意儿是变形金刚写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saying a transformer wrote that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.32,0:12:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那是威震天\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That's Megatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.52,0:13:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.53,0:13:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,变形金刚 是威震天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The transformer … it's Megatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.23,0:13:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.46,0:13:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,神的书记员\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the scribe of god.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,创世的过程中 由他记录神的口谕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took down dictation when creation was being formed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是神之语了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the word of god?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.64,0:13:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中之一 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.67,0:13:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那到底写的是什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…well, what's it say, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.68,0:13:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,树\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Tree"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.52,0:13:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,马 招潮蟹 我读不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Horse"? "Fiddler crab"? I can't read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.32,0:13:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是写给天使看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't meant for angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.59,0:13:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 真是糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this all sounds bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩蠢货怎么会拿到神之语的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you two jackasses doing with the word of god?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.87,0:13:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off, Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.03,0:13:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 这也是我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, it's my ass, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.13,0:13:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.63,0:13:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这套「恶魔是二等公民」的架势滚一边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough of this "Demons are second-class citizens" Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.77,0:13:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喜欢吵架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't like conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.14,0:13:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.38,0:13:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了 他说不喜欢吵架\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard him. He doesn't like conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.51,0:13:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去休息室了 我能担保\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's down in the dayroom now. I guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.91,0:13:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我去搞定小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll go handle Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.18,0:14:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你能负责收拾神之语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, will you please pick up the word of god?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.02,0:14:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.86,0:14:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这是惹了什么麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys caught up in now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.63,0:14:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有权知道 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deserve to know, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.17,0:14:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.24,0:14:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hit the road, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带上我的天使就上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me just go get my angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅格 你说什么呢 站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg, what are you talking about? Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起喊 你说小卡会跟谁走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both call, who do you think Cass will come to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.65,0:14:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也听到了 什么带刺的美人儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard him … thorny beauty, blah, blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是陪在他身边的圣徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the saint who stayed with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他欠我的 他的原话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He owes me. His words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.03,0:14:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他欠我们的怎么算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what about what he owes us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他施展魅力吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, work on him a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.93,0:14:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准他会爱上你呢 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he'll start crushing on you, too, hot stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.53,0:14:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经兮兮的天使对你有什么用 别傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do with a broken angel? Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.67,0:14:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对获取力量不挑拣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take power where I can get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.57,0:14:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要照顾我自己呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got myself to look out for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.97,0:15:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.10,0:15:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别追了 别来追我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, stop, leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.48,0:15:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是恶魔也不是大嘴怪 你到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a demon or a chomper. What the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.82,0:15:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是凯文·谭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a… K-Kevin Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.09,0:15:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在读大学预修课 不要杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in advanced placement. P-p-p-p-please don't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.56,0:15:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没打算杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.17,0:16:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm sorry. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.14,0:16:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么回事 但我不能放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't … I don't know why, but I can't let go of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.42,0:16:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道你打碎了神之语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize you just broke god's word?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是萨姆的那些噩梦对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam's thing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.04,0:16:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把他的创伤后遗症弄到自己身上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You taking on his, uh, cage-match scars.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你现在变成这样的原因 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing that's what broke your bank, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.78,0:16:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走到这一步 费尽千辛万苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it took… everything to get me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.98,0:16:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么呢 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.84,0:16:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我知道你不想听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I know you want different answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.59,0:16:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我想你扣上风衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I want you to button up your coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.69,0:17:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助我们搞定利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and help us take down Leviathans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得你做过什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember what you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.81,0:17:21.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（抱歉）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要先走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to go first?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真蹚进这趟浑水了 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really stepped in it, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.13,0:17:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.83,0:17:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道这 这是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is, this is … it's for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.97,0:17:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这应该由我保管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.70,0:17:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.44,0:17:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你也不知道那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.91,0:17:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始谁也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we weren't sure at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.41,0:18:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪种猴子能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}which monkeys were gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.91,0:18:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别生气 不过我当时喜欢尼安德塔人（穴居人）\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, but I was backing the Neanderthals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.45,0:18:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的诗实在太美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because their poetry was…just amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.22,0:18:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,与周围环境浑然一体\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in perfect tune with the spheres.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.19,0:18:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最终 还是你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in the end, it was you …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.26,0:18:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些现代智人的后人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The home sapiens sapiens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.46,0:18:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些家伙偷吃了苹果 创造了裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys ate the apple, invented pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.23,0:18:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 我们去哪儿找这个梅塔特隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}cass, where do we find this, uh, Metatron?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.20,0:18:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 不过你得退回原点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I … I think you have to go back to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.80,0:18:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事真的很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.48,0:19:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得梅塔特隆能够阻止很多坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Metatron could stop a lot of bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.69,0:19:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们住在一个很「抱歉」的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}We live in a "Sorry" universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.99,0:19:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就该充满冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's engineered to create conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.63,0:19:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 我为何能从你的不幸中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why should I prosper from…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.63,0:19:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,获利呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}your misfortune?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.40,0:19:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但规矩就是规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these are the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.17,0:19:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,规矩不是我定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't make them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.64,0:19:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些就是你定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made some of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.14,0:19:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你试图变成上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you tried to become God,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.97,0:19:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开墙上的那个洞时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you cut that hole through that wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.38,0:19:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.75,0:19:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.78,0:19:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the damn game!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.85,0:19:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,别玩游戏了 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the game, cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.69,0:19:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.46,0:19:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:19:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,「抱歉」只是一盘棋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're playing "Sorry"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.17,0:20:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,上头都是字\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.28,0:20:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的 我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, we get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.38,0:20:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,利维坦是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Leviathan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.01,0:20:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你能认出来 上头写着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You can read it? Is that what it says?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.78,0:20:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧 很费劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of. It hurts a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.68,0:20:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就像戴着别人的眼镜在看这些字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like looking through somebody else's glasses,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.45,0:20:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think it…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.52,0:20:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面写着关于利维坦的事 他们的出处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about Leviathan, how it came to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.69,0:20:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝把他锁进了深渊 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}God locked him up far away, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.19,0:20:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像关进了监狱 因为他们非常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like in jail… because they're so…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.83,0:20:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们真实存在的 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they're real, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.67,0:20:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 凯文 他们存在 在地球上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Kevin. They … they are. And they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有写怎么杀死他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it say anything about how to kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.41,0:20:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 他们很难杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause that's … that's kind of been a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.21,0:20:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 这不像普通的阅读\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It's not like reading reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.22,0:20:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难长时间集中注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It … it's hard to focus on it too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.02,0:20:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.75,0:20:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.09,0:20:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 淡定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.23,0:20:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.70,0:21:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.78,0:21:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.98,0:21:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在跟天使说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's talking to angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.85,0:21:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔婊子和温家兄弟 又是这种组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon whore and a Winchester…again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.38,0:21:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,离先知远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step away from the prophet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.39,0:21:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说谁 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.79,0:21:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡间唯一的神之语的守护者 我们来带你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sole keeper of the word on earth, we are here to take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.69,0:21:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说「带我走」是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "Take"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了这个恶魔和她的小情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the demon and her lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.60,0:21:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这样的 我们不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not how it … we're not …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.07,0:21:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪里搞来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.41,0:21:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.24,0:21:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.05,0:21:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 海斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Hester.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在天堂大开杀戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smote thousands in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.16,0:22:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了番恐怖的话 然后就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave a big, scary speech. Then you were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.46,0:22:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那算怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.10,0:22:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 那确实不太礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rude, for one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.84,0:22:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.67,0:22:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃纳亚斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Inias.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.31,0:22:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,海斯特 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hester, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.14,0:22:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you want something …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.72,0:22:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.18,0:22:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.62,0:22:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望我能帮你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish it could be that …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.62,0:22:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还能教你很多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are still many things I can teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.39,0:22:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能开拓你们的视角\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can offer, um, well, perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.06,0:22:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.13,0:22:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉我的手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull my finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅格会去换盏灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg will … will get another light,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.34,0:22:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来把它灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll … I'll blow it out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.54,0:22:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样会很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, well, this time, it'll be funny,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.97,0:22:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回想过去 笑笑就过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll all look back and laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.34,0:22:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.61,0:22:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 小美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的天使都滚回老家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All angels blown back to their corners.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.99,0:23:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最多有三四个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got like three, four hours tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.36,0:23:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅格 你从哪儿弄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg, where did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.46,0:23:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年死了很多天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of angels died this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.03,0:23:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.27,0:23:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.91,0:23:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.84,0:23:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫凯文·谭\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh… Kevin Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.28,0:23:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是预科生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, uh, in advanced placement.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.01,0:23:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说这些利维坦 这些怪物是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, these Leviathans … these monsters are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.12,0:23:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那带翼天使呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And angels with wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.31,0:23:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.96,0:23:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有翅膀 什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wings. No anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.85,0:23:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥乱七八糟的都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No junk. Junkless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.20,0:23:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 你能认出上帝之石上的那些鬼画桃符\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Kevin, you can, uh, read the chicken scratch on the God rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.45,0:23:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,又变成一整块了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is back in one piece, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.36,0:23:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说那上面写着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're saying that there's some sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.33,0:24:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,「杀死迪克指南」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}a "How to punch Dick" recipe in there somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.57,0:24:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.26,0:24:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得这就像是紧急情况指南\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it seems kind of like an "In case of emergency" Note.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.91,0:24:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么喊我先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they mean by "Prophet"?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.58,0:24:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 来真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.86,0:24:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 天使是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, that's what the angel said.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.52,0:24:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不想做什么先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be a prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.00,0:24:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 谁也不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You don't at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.49,0:24:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 咱们得开始逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, we've got to start running and hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.40,0:24:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你们想留下继续跟他们纠缠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do you want to tangle with those wing nuts twice?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.34,0:24:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 谁跟你「咱们」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Did you say "We"?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.16,0:24:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在被天使们盯上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on the angels' radar now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.66,0:24:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得多拉些人保全性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I don't need a little safety in numbers?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.90,0:24:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 咱们回鲁弗斯的小屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we'll go to Rufus' cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.14,0:24:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,让这孩子去那儿做读书报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid can do his book report there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.44,0:24:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,您饿了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know you're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.47,0:24:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,来比格森自制馅饼吧饱餐一顿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not enjoy Biggerson's homemade pie bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.59,0:24:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖馅饼的沙拉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a salad bar but with pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.16,0:25:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续播报新闻十台的头条新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now back to our top story on News 10,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.69,0:25:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,失踪好学生一案的搜寻进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}the search for the missing honor student.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.53,0:25:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,此案的受害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The victim in this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.67,0:25:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,据称坚持他天命如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}reportedly insisted he'd been chosen by birthright,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.70,0:25:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,使人们猜测绑架可能与邪教有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}causing speculation that a cult may be behind the abduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.89,0:25:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里的车也一同丢失\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family car is also missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.98,0:25:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦政府已经处于戒备状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Federal authorities have been placed on alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.37,0:25:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次报道 十六岁的好学生凯文·谭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again, 16-year-old honor student Kevin Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.50,0:25:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨日早些时候被人从他密歇根的家中带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}reportedly taken from his Michigan home early yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.80,0:25:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.09,0:25:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一波未平一波又起\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we got another wrinkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.56,0:25:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似凯文据报失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, looks like Kevin's gone missing…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.53,0:25:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,而联邦政府正在调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's gone federal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.33,0:25:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么背\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.87,0:25:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅格呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Meg?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.88,0:25:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.10,0:25:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好 现在我们成绑架犯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, so now we're kidnappers?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.51,0:25:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱说不就得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if we shut up about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.46,0:25:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 我们绑架了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Who'd we kidnap?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.00,0:26:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.40,0:26:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.71,0:26:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.76,0:26:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.28,0:26:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.70,0:26:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My future…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.12,0:26:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My girlfriend…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.14,0:26:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.20,0:26:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Castiel. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.80,0:26:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 在哪 他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass? Where? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.29,0:26:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 不 小卡 你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. No. No, Cass. You talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.09,0:26:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珀斯 - 澳大利亚的那个「珀斯」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Perth? - "Perth"? As in Australia?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.42,0:26:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.71,0:26:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他被一群愤怒的狗狗包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says he's surrounded by unhappy dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.22,0:26:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.16,0:26:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在珀斯的赛狗赛道上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's at a dog track in Perth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.16,0:26:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被一群愤怒的大狗包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surrounded by large unhappy dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.31,0:26:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们愤怒是因为兔子是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they're unhappy 'cause the rabbit's fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.50,0:26:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在明尼苏达州圣克芬德北面的94号公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we're on Highway 94, north of St. Cloud, Minnesota,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.31,0:26:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚经过79英里标志牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just passing mile marker 79.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.95,0:26:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 这位是卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, this is Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.19,0:26:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're one of the angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.56,0:27:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 梅格 你受伤了吗 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Meg, are you hurt? - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.36,0:27:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 刚刚怎么回事 那些人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, what happened back there? Who were those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.09,0:27:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是卫戍队的人 以前是我的卫戍队\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're from the garrison… my old garrison.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.96,0:27:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来海斯特接管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Hester's taken over.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.70,0:27:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的任务是守望地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were assigned to watch the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.08,0:27:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常都很无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Often, it was boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.96,0:27:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争很无聊 还有性爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wars were very boring and the sex…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.52,0:27:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是一样的套路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the repetition.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.49,0:27:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I was, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.76,0:27:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他们的队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was their captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.31,0:27:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.72,0:27:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 他们干嘛现在来找我们麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, why are they pissed at us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.87,0:27:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些赛狗真是惨啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, those racing dogs were absolutely miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.59,0:27:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的思维都是赛道型的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can only think in ovals.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.76,0:27:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 别逼我靠边停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, don't make me pull this car over!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.72,0:27:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使为什么追着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are angels after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.99,0:27:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你生气了吗 你为什么要生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you angry? Why are you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.76,0:27:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I-I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.98,0:27:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 能不能说正事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, can we just stay on target?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.73,0:27:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要生气 他们只是照章办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no reason for anger. They're only following protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.21,0:27:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,当神之语显现\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the word of God is revealed,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.22,0:27:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,其守护者就会苏醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}a keeper of the word will awaken,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.47,0:27:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像这个烫手山芋\N{\fnArial\fs30}like this hot potato right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.79,0:27:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.02,0:27:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.22,0:28:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫戍队法令指示其队员带守护者去沙漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}garrison code dictates you take the keeper to the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.09,0:28:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离人类 而后得悉神之语\N{\fnArial\fs30}to learn the word away from men.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.79,0:28:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of sense does that make?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.74,0:28:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得告诉我们讲了什么 我们才好加以利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to tell us so that we can use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.84,0:28:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是上帝的鬼把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's God and his shiny red apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.01,0:28:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能住在沙漠里 我在申请普林斯顿大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't live in the desert. I-I'm applying to Princeton!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.10,0:28:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你说 去他妈的卫戍队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know what? Screw the garrison.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.63,0:28:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要那块碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.59,0:28:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,来终结迪克·罗曼的吃死我们的阴谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}to end Dick Roman's "soylent us" crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.01,0:28:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要知道神之语\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want the word,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.42,0:28:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得躲着海斯特和她手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll have to duck Hester and her soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.14,0:28:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我们是一条战线的吧 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're in our corner, right, Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.36,0:28:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再战斗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.48,0:28:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我观察蜜蜂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watch the bees.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.27,0:28:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别画天使驱逐符了 我也会被你们驱逐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's leave off angel-proofing sigils or I'll be expelled, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.89,0:28:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你的卫戍队员看不到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as we're invisible to your garrison buddies,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.48,0:28:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}it works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.13,0:28:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定很饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you're pretty hungry,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.86,0:28:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼上的事一搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}so once we get settled in upstairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.55,0:28:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就弄点晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll get some dinner going.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.12,0:28:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里看起来像是性虐地牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This looks like a sex-torture dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.78,0:29:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是性虐地牢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a sex-torture dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.17,0:29:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这里不是性虐\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is not a sex-torture…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.57,0:29:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 坐下看碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over here. Sit down and read, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.80,0:29:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你似乎有心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.89,0:29:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你这人就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, that's a primary aspect of your personality,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.20,0:29:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我有时不去管你\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I sometimes ignore it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.95,0:29:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.53,0:29:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在是在想你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…right now I'm just wondering about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.60,0:29:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.14,0:29:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在担心我从你身上接过的重担\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're worried about the burden I lifted from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.58,0:29:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I was done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.84,0:29:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看到路西法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.17,0:29:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.91,0:29:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.98,0:29:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是你梦魇的投射 类似余味\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a projection of yours, I think, sort of an aftertaste.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.29,0:30:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在我看到的更多是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I more see…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.38,0:30:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,天地万物\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.45,0:30:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好笑 我本来也完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's funny. I was… I was done for, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.13,0:30:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我造的孽的重责\N{\fnArial\fs30}The weight of all my mistakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.25,0:30:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些失去的生命和灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}all those lives and souls lost, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.08,0:30:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也无法承受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't take it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.58,0:30:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.04,0:30:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本迷失方向 直到接过你的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was lost until I took on your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.60,0:30:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起来奇怪 这反而会帮了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's strange to think that that helped, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.62,0:30:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你一心想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you never did anything but try to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.87,0:30:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 小卡 我也很感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realize that, Cass, and I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.09,0:30:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都很感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.58,0:30:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会帮你好转起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna help you get better, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.55,0:30:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不计一切代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.22,0:30:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫「好转起来」\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "better"?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.72,0:31:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.20,0:31:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.73,0:31:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生活怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happened to my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.43,0:31:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是个密歇根的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a kid from Michigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.67,0:31:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想做神之语的守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to be a word keeper!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.40,0:31:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来得用呼吸袋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we're brown-baggin' it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.30,0:31:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没准备好接受世界上存在超自然力量呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not prepared to factor the supernatural into my world view.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.00,0:31:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, there we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.13,0:31:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 吸气呼气 放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. That's it. Just breathe. Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.15,0:31:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道该说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man. What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.39,0:31:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是天选之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.75,0:31:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这感觉糟透了 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it sucks. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.54,0:31:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,问「为什么选我」是没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no use asking "Why me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.10,0:31:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为天使根本不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause the angels… they don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.59,0:32:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们就是关心无能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think maybe they just don't have the equipment to care.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.86,0:32:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他们想去关心的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like when they try, it just…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.16,0:32:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}…breaks them apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.18,0:32:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想成为第一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to be the first Asian-American.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.13,0:32:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚裔美国总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}president of the united states.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.49,0:32:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,先干活吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then do your homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.29,0:32:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我如约而至了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? I'm here, just like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.11,0:33:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好说点有用的 荡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd better start talking, skank.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.96,0:33:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我干嘛不拖着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me again why I'm not just hauling you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.80,0:33:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找地狱之王领赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the king's cash window.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.36,0:33:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 拉斯科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Rosco.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.18,0:33:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 我手上有更好的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you. I've got something way better.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.58,0:33:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道克劳力喜欢礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how Crowley likes presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.75,0:33:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才不在乎温家兄弟呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna care if we bring in the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.04,0:33:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,都好久的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday's news.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.91,0:33:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是温彻斯特兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.03,0:33:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有出卖他的那个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got the angel who double-crossed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.03,0:33:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.92,0:33:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel … he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.72,0:33:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你什么都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, 'cause you're in that loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.20,0:33:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.33,0:33:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我要知道我得跟你们多少人分赏钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, I want to know how many of you jerks I have to cut in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.75,0:33:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我们傻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think we're stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.13,0:33:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可没有告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't tell anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.22,0:33:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱死恶魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.07,0:34:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到你还回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't expect to see you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.12,0:34:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没有跟恶魔军团一起回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not without the King's army.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.79,0:34:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.93,0:34:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.96,0:34:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I save our bacon,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.08,0:34:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你们画个恶魔陷阱在这儿等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're sitting here, waiting by a devil's trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.32,0:34:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 我刚刚杀了两个克劳力的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, I just killed two of Crowley's men.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.35,0:34:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本可出卖你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have gone the other way on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.12,0:34:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true, incidentally.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.63,0:34:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀上还有其他恶魔的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's other demons' blood on that blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.61,0:34:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比你们想的要单纯得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm simpler than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.34,0:34:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我悟出了这世间的一个道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've figured one thing out about this world …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.97,0:34:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那么一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one, pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.97,0:35:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到一个目标 然后为之效力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find a cause, and you serve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.59,0:35:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉溺于此 碌碌一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give yourself over, and it orders your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.31,0:35:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我就是为了拯救路西法和黄眼怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer and yellow eyes … their mission was it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.59,0:35:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就该相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? We should trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.30,0:35:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你要解救地狱里的撒旦\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you wanted to free satan from hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.34,0:35:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是目标 傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking "Cause, " douche bag,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.63,0:35:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像早上起床的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in reason to get up in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.26,0:35:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然 此一时彼一时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, these things shift over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.40,0:35:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们长教训 变成熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We learn, we grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.89,0:35:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在我的目标就是击败地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, for me currently, the cause is bringing down the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.27,0:35:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道我需要帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know we'll need help to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.21,0:35:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力现在可不是什么麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley ain't the problem this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.99,0:35:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候能明白 克劳力永远是麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are you gonna get it? Crowley's always the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.34,0:35:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是在等合适的时机出手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just waiting for the right moment to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.61,0:35:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我该干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I'm supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.75,0:35:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不会伤害萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it isn't screw with Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.39,0:35:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是唯一会挺我的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or lose the only angel who'd go to bat for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.42,0:35:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is good …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.82,0:35:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,和谐共处 相互沟通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harmony, communication.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.75,0:35:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们唯一的麻烦就是海斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now our only problem is Hester.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.74,0:36:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.56,0:36:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在躲避卫戍队的追捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here, we're hidden from the garrison,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.70,0:36:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你杀了个恶魔 我们就彻底暴露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when you killed a demon, you put out a pretty clear beacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.19,0:36:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得马上增强天使驱逐符\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need better angel-proofing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.68,0:36:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然从我们手中夺走先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took the prophet from us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.63,0:36:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm … I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.93,0:36:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经彻头彻尾的堕落了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have fallen in every way imaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.00,0:36:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.74,0:36:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须遵循法令 帮我们完成工作吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to follow the code. Help us do our work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.12,0:36:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能帮助你 他谁也帮不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't help you. He can't help anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.00,0:36:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要他的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need his help…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.26,0:36:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是应允\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or his permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.97,0:36:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚就带守护者去沙漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}The keeper goes to the desert tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.27,0:36:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们别多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.27,0:36:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可是在帮你们天使擦屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're actually trying to clean up one of your angel's messes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.88,0:36:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.95,0:36:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.03,0:36:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是某个天使把利维坦带回了这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}An angel brought the leviathan back into this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.85,0:36:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时他们恳求他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and … and they begged him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.51,0:36:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,求他不要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}They begged him not to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.11,0:36:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们点时间好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just give us some time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.29,0:36:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会照看好先知的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will take care of your prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.37,0:37:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们还要给你任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should we give you anything…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.24,0:37:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿走的还不够多吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything you have taken from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.36,0:37:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你毁灭了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The very touch of you corrupts.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.50,0:37:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初卡西迪奥从地狱救你出来 他就迷失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Castiel first laid a hand on you in hell, he was lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.09,0:37:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为此 你就要付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}For that, you're going to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.66,0:37:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.11,0:37:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来这儿是为了保护他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the ones we were put here to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.55,0:37:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.93,0:37:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,该停止疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.90,0:37:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,该停止许诺了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more promises!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.24,0:37:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的新上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more new gods!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.96,0:37:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,海斯特 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hester! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.78,0:37:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.82,0:37:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使已经所剩无几了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's so few of us left.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.58,0:37:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要自由意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.79,0:37:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm making the choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.15,0:38:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.67,0:38:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有人下手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.97,0:38:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪的年月啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are strange times.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.50,0:38:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得就没正常过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they've always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.49,0:38:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望你能跟我们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you'd come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.11,0:38:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再是卫戍队的一员了 埃纳亚斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm not part of the garrison anymore, Inias.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.89,0:38:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.65,0:38:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.82,0:38:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人会承受不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a lot of people could handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.48,0:38:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都写完了吗 天选之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You doing all right there, "Chosen one"?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.87,0:38:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.91,0:38:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗 凯文·谭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready, Kevin Tran?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.69,0:38:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,送守护者回家 我们可以在那儿照看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the keeper to his home. We can watch over him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.70,0:39:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找不到梅格了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't find Meg anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.45,0:39:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她比较喜欢躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, she enjoys laying low.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.23,0:39:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.35,0:39:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,若要杀死利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leviathan cannot be slain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.32,0:39:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能用正直凡人之骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}but by a bone of a righteous mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.28,0:39:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,浸以三滴堕落天使之血\N{\fnArial\fs30}washed in the three bloods of the fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.76,0:39:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面说我们先要找到堕落天使的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says we need to start with the blood of a fallen angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.31,0:39:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们了解我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.27,0:39:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是愿意为温家兄弟流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm always happy to bleed for the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.18,0:39:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接下来要怎么办 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do, Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.78,0:39:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.69,0:39:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这多好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.96,0:40:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去干活吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.25,0:40:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing everything we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.63,0:40:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谭女士 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Tran, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.67,0:40:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他发了癫痫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he'd had a s-seizure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.29,0:40:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他们打他了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What … what if they hit him?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.29,0:40:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他脑损伤了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if he has a brain injury?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.18,0:40:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要相信我们 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to trust us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.10,0:40:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞎担心也是没有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't help to wear yourself out with worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.25,0:40:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.22,0:40:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.29,0:40:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.41,0:40:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 妈妈 是他们带我回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's … it's okay, mom. They brought me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.92,0:40:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来保护我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're keeping me safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.85,0:40:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.25,0:40:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,石头打败剪刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rock beats scissor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.96,0:40:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,利维坦杀死天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leviathan beats angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.91,0:41:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Kevin.
